{"obsah":"<p>Last week Vlasta and our young club gun Tobík Dolák rode an exhibition for Alternativo at the beautiful Valeč chateau, where they held a small IT conference focused on security. And since you ride safely on a bike too and the gentlemen from the management are athletes, they chose us. Low ceilings, a slippery floor, and Tobík forgot his helmet. Not exactly the ideal combo for an exhibition. The helmet wasn't a disaster, because one of the bosses is his dad – so as punishment he just had to tidy up.</p>\n\n<p>We also roped in a young intern and a few conference visitors, so everyone was happy and we got a few photos too.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F11%2F20231115_133958sm.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F11%2F20231115_133958sm.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-239449\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F11%2F20231115_134701sm.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F11%2F20231115_134701sm.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-239450\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F11%2F20231115_134921sm.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F11%2F20231115_134921sm.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-239448\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F11%2F20231115_135140sm.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F11%2F20231115_135140sm.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-239451\"/></a></figure>\n</figure>"}